我超想看看马车。
I love to see a horse and carriage.

822
00:53:47,060 --> 00:53:48,900
看看这儿。太棒了。
Look at that. It's fantastic.

823
00:53:48,900 --> 00:53:51,260
然而，我们被来了一记震惊。
However, we were in for a shock.

824
00:54:00,140 --> 00:54:02,500
它真的这么写了吧？
It does say that, doesn't it?

825
00:54:02,500 --> 00:54:05,780
的确，它就是这么写的。
It does. It does say that.

826
00:54:05,780 --> 00:54:08,420
827
00:54:08,420 --> 00:54:11,060
欢迎来到…… 那玩意儿。
That's what it says. And it is
the name of the town. It's not...

827
00:54:08,420 --> 00:54:11,060
Welcome to... That.
Welcome to... That.

828
00:54:13,180 --> 00:54:18,420
你不觉得那下面有个叫“前戏”的小镇，我们应该先去逛逛吗？
You don't think there was a hamlet
called Foreplay down there we
should have popped into first?

829
00:54:20,900 --> 00:54:24,100
我们很快离开了阿米什地区，几个小时后惊喜地发现
We quickly left Amish country and
were delighted a few hours later

830
00:54:24,100 --> 00:54:28,700
我们正要驶向一个稍微不那么“下流”的地方。
to find ourselves approaching
somewhere a bit less smutty.

831
00:54:28,700 --> 00:54:32,060
好，这就到了。Noo Yoik。
Well, this is it. Noo Yoik.

832
00:54:39,020 --> 00:54:45,140
第二天早上，我们被告知要去布鲁克林接受挑战。
And the following morning we were
told to report to Brooklyn
for a challenge.

833
00:54:45,140 --> 00:54:47,300
好的。
Right.

834
00:54:47,300 --> 00:54:53,460
“你们被安排在今天上午11点上美国脱口秀节目出现。”
"You have been booked to appear
at 11 o'clock this morning
on an American chat show.

835
00:54:53,460 --> 00:54:59,380
“演播室在西59街，靠近与第11大道的交叉口。”
"The studio is on West 59th Street
near its junction with 11th Avenue.

836
00:54:59,380 --> 00:55:05,220
“只能让你们其中一个上场，谁先到谁就拿到机会。”我能问一下，
"There's only time for one of you
to appear, so the first to arrive
gets the gig." Can I just ask,

837
00:55:06,820 --> 00:55:09,220
它并没有说我不能用卫星导航。
it doesn't say
I can't use my sat-nav.

838
00:55:09,220 --> 00:55:12,220
我也不行。
Nor me.

839
00:55:12,220 --> 00:55:15,300
我没有卫星导航。我们要不要这么干？还有一个小时吗？
I haven't got sat-nav.
Shall we do it? Have we got an hour?

840
00:55:15,300 --> 00:55:16,820
可以。
Yes.

841
00:55:16,820 --> 00:55:19,340
脱口秀。
Chat show.

842
00:55:19,340 --> 00:55:24,820
三、二、冲！好。
Three, two, go! OK.

843
00:55:29,820 --> 00:55:34,380
设定导航。曼哈顿城。
Set navigation. City of Manhattan.

844
00:55:34,380 --> 00:55:37,260
M.A.在哪儿……
Where's M. A...

845
00:55:40,540 --> 00:55:44,340
在卫星导航里怎么输入西59街？
How do you enter West 59
in the sat-nav?

846
00:55:44,340 --> 00:55:46,820
不容易，不过我倒是搞定了。再见。
It's not easy, but luckily
I've managed it. Goodbye.

847
00:55:49,980 --> 00:55:53,020
看起来不错，挺好的。搞定，出发。
Looking good, looking good.
Done it. Go.

848
00:56:00,780 --> 00:56:04,460
前面，保时捷在布鲁克林大桥上
Up ahead, the Porsche
was on Brooklyn Bridge

849
00:56:04,460 --> 00:56:06,460
极速冲向曼哈顿。
zooming towards Manhattan.

850
00:56:09,380 --> 00:56:13,380
这可是把小斯图尔特吓得哆嗦。
Which made Stuart Little
very nervous.

851
00:56:13,380 --> 00:56:17,220
不，别呀。我的天！快看看，太大了。
No. No.
My God. Look at it. It's huge.

852
00:56:19,380 --> 00:56:22,420
我是土包子，这话不假。
I'm a country boy.
That's just a fact.

853
00:56:22,420 --> 00:56:24,020
城市把我吓坏了。
Cities terrify me.

854
00:56:24,020 --> 00:56:28,660
太大、太乱，还有一堆爱大喊大叫的傻子。
They're just big and complicated
and full of people who shout at you.

855
00:56:31,940 --> 00:56:34,220
开始！
Here we go.

856
00:56:34,220 --> 00:56:37,460
制作人只给了我们一条规矩。
The producers had
given us only one rule.

857
00:56:37,460 --> 00:56:41,620
不能走环绕曼哈顿海岸的环路。
We weren't allowed to use
the ring roads that go up
Manhattan shoreline.

858
00:56:41,620 --> 00:56:45,980
管它呢，我们这些导航兄弟倒是相当悠哉。
But no matter. Us sat-nav boys
were feeling pretty relaxed.

859
00:56:45,980 --> 00:56:47,900
嗨，美国。
Hello, America.

860
00:56:47,900 --> 00:56:52,580
先进曼哈顿演播室，再冲向全世界。
Manhattan TV studio
and then the world.

861
00:56:52,580 --> 00:56:56,420
可能是《早安美国》，那可是大节目。
Could be Good Morning America.
That is a big show.

862
00:56:56,420 --> 00:56:59,980
哈蒙德必定抢着抢先到。
Hammond will be desperate
to get there first.

863
00:56:59,980 --> 00:57:05,620
他从胎儿时期起，就注定要上美国电视。
Because ever since he was
a foetus, he's been destined
to appear on American television.

864
00:57:05,620 --> 00:57:08,940
牙齿、发型，样样都得上。
With his teeth
and his hair and everything.

865
00:57:08,940 --> 00:57:11,900
我要去珍珠街吗？
Do I want Pearl Street?

866
00:57:11,900 --> 00:57:16,180
公园路南段？我不知道！真的不知道。
Park Road south? I don't know!
I don't know.

867
00:57:18,340 --> 00:57:22,100
詹姆斯意气风发冲进曼哈顿。
James steamed into Manhattan
full of confidence.

868
00:57:22,100 --> 00:57:24,580
公园路南，靠右。
Park Road South, keep right.

869
00:57:24,580 --> 00:57:26,940
靠左，没错。
Keep left, yes.

870
00:57:26,940 --> 00:57:29,420
但很快他就出问题了。
But soon he had a problem.

871
00:57:29,420 --> 00:57:31,180
卫星信号丢了。
I've lost the satellite signal.

872
00:57:31,180 --> 00:57:33,740
都是那些高楼的锅。
It's the buildings.

873
00:57:33,740 --> 00:57:38,660
倒是恰好，曼哈顿满足了詹姆斯的秩序癖
Annoyingly, though, Manhattan
suited James's love of order

874
00:57:38,660 --> 00:57:44,580
街道都是编号网格，逻辑感十足。
and logic because the streets are
laid out in a numbered grid system.

875
00:57:44,580 --> 00:57:48,220
只能四个方向：向东、向西，或者向北、向南。
You can only go four ways.
You can go east or west or
you can go north or south.

876
00:57:48,220 --> 00:57:54,860
没有弯曲，也几乎没有对角线。集中注意力。
There's no windy stuff, and there's
very little in the way of
diagonal stuff. Concentrate.

877
00:57:56,780 --> 00:58:03,500
在SLS里，导航不受建筑干扰，但它简直太德国了。
In the SLS, the sat-nav was
not affected by the buildings,
but it was being very German.

878
00:58:03,500 --> 00:58:07,100
啊，你看，导航选了环路。
Ah, you see, the
sat-nav has selected the ring road.

879
00:58:07,100 --> 00:58:08,860
看，它判断要让我上去。
Look, it's judged to take me up.

880
00:58:08,860 --> 00:58:11,060
我干不成。
I can't do that.

881
00:58:11,060 --> 00:58:15,740
我把车开进了城中心，逼系统重新思考。
I drove deeper into the
heart of the city to
force the system to think again.

882
00:58:15,740 --> 00:58:20,500
导航仪还死死要我走环路，我可受不了。
Sat-nav's still trying to make me go
on the ring road. I can't do that.

883
00:58:20,500 --> 00:58:22,300
注意！左转……不行！
Attention! Turn left... No!

884
00:58:22,300 --> 00:58:24,140
我就是不上环路。
I can't go on the ring road.

885
00:58:24,140 --> 00:58:26,580
我要让它闭嘴。
I'm going to shut her up.

886
00:58:26,580 --> 00:58:29,540
只要一直往北开，直奔59街。
If I just keep heading north
until I get to 59th Street.

887
00:58:29,540 --> 00:58:32,500
有多难？
How hard can that be?

888
00:58:32,500 --> 00:58:35,940
我们现在只能靠脑子找
All of us were now relying on
intelligence alone to find

889
00:58:35,940 --> 00:58:42,580
电视演播室，老实说，这让斯图尔特·小子有点劣势。
the TV studio, and if I'm honest,
that did put Stuart Little at a
bit of a disadvantage.

890
00:58:42,580 --> 00:58:45,780
不，不要，我不想进去。
No, no. I don't want to go.

891
00:58:45,780 --> 00:58:49,340
不？我咋才能不进隧道？
No? How do I not go in the tunnel?

892
00:58:49,340 --> 00:58:52,820
我不会慌的，我不会慌的，绝不慌。
I'm not going to panic. I'm not
going to panic. Not going to panic.

893
00:58:52,820 --> 00:58:56,940
挡风玻璃雨刷亮起——这可不妙。
I've indicated with the
windscreen wipers - that's bad.

894
00:58:56,940 --> 00:58:58,580
好的，往北走。
Right. Going north.

895
00:58:58,580 --> 00:59:02,220
我马上开始数街道编号。
I'll start to count off
street numbers in a minute.

896
00:59:02,220 --> 00:59:05,060
一直开，直到到达59号。
Just keep going until I get to 59.

897
00:59:07,660 --> 00:59:11,260
强迫症队长进展神速。
Captain OCD
was making storming progress.

898
00:59:13,500 --> 00:59:17,020
第14街，挺不错。
14th street. This is good.

899
00:59:18,620 --> 00:59:20,380
不知道杰兹在哪儿。
I wonder where Jezza is.

900
00:59:20,380 --> 00:59:25,900
倒霉的是，我选的北向道路有点堵。
Annoyingly, the northbound
street I'd selected was a bit busy.

901
00:59:25,900 --> 00:59:28,020
没办法，我被卡得死死的。
Nothing I can do.
I'm completely jammed in.

902
00:59:28,020 --> 00:59:31,420
滴答，滴答，滴答。
Tick-tock, tick-tock, tick-tock.

903
00:59:31,420 --> 00:59:36,060
再慌点儿，快动！
A bit more panicking. Move!

904
00:59:40,020 --> 00:59:42,740
第23街，他们已经乱套。
23rd Street. They're tumbling.

905
00:59:42,740 --> 00:59:46,460
我自信满满，决定在瓶颈处穿梭。
I was so confident, I decided
to weave round bottlenecks.

906
00:59:46,460 --> 00:59:49,980
下面……超简单！
Down there... It's easy!

907
00:59:51,980 --> 00:59:54,940
哦，不。
Oh, no.

908
00:59:54,940 --> 00:59:57,300
东14街。
East 14th Street.

909
00:59:57,300 --> 00:59:59,020
得冲到59！
I've got to go to 59!

910
00:59:59,020 --> 01:00:02,620
而我现在只有36分钟赶到。
And I've now got
36 minutes to get there.

911
01:00:02,620 --> 01:00:05,060
不过，还能更糟。
Still, could be worse.

912
01:00:05,060 --> 01:00:08,780
哈蒙德来了！就是哈蒙德！
There's Hammond! That's Hammond!

913
01:00:10,300 --> 01:00:12,940
天呐……啊！那不──
Dear... Aaah! That doesn't...

914
01:00:12,940 --> 01:00:14,900
我到底哪里搞错了？
What am I doing wrong?

915
01:00:14,900 --> 01:00:19,620
那一刻，我也在自问同样的问题。
At that moment, I was asking myself
the same question.

916
01:00:24,540 --> 01:00:26,220
哔——，搞错了。
BLEEP. Done it wrong.

917
01:00:26,220 --> 01:00:31,380
我肯定是拐角那个后部合金卡住了。
I must have caught the rear
alloy on the corner of that.

918
01:00:31,380 --> 01:00:35,140
现在后轮就在那边。行吗？
Right now it's the back
wheel over there. Good?

919
01:00:37,380 --> 01:00:43,100
既然浪费了宝贵时间，我决定走主干道。
Having lost valuable time, I decided
to stick to the main streets.

920
01:00:43,100 --> 01:00:46,940
美洲大道，挺好的。
Avenue of the Americas.
This is good.

921
01:00:50,460 --> 01:00:54,020
这条路简直惊艳，叫做美国大道。
This is an astonishing road,
the Avenue of the Americas.

922
01:00:56,340 --> 01:00:58,900
看看那儿，混凝土峡谷！
Look at that. Concrete canyon!

923
01:01:03,860 --> 01:01:06,620
我好像刚刚在那边看到詹姆斯了。
I think I just saw James over there.

924
01:01:06,620 --> 01:01:09,660
是吧！哈！看我找到了啥！
Yes! Ha ha! Look what I've found!

925
01:01:09,660 --> 01:01:11,660
Jezza。
Jezza.

926
01:01:11,660 --> 01:01:13,620
有意思。
That's interesting.

927
01:01:13,620 --> 01:01:19,860
终于想看看我们的哪辆车最快，诱惑太大了。
It was very tempting to finally see
which of our cars was the fastest.

928
01:01:19,860 --> 01:01:22,820
咱们可不能这么干。
We mustn't do this.

929
01:01:22,820 --> 01:01:25,420
可我们又硬是决定要这么干。
And then we decided that we must.

930
01:01:27,140 --> 01:01:29,500
准备手动挡上路。
Going to go manual.

931
01:01:29,500 --> 01:01:33,860
这波加速或许能决定谁上美国电视！
This burst of acceleration
could decide who goes
on American television!

932
01:01:45,940 --> 01:01:50,180
可惜，赛还没结束就卡住了。我慌忙踩刹车…
Sadly, before the race was done,
we hit traffic. So I braked...

933
01:01:50,180 --> 01:01:53,180
然后直接掉头。就这样。
and bailed. That's that.

934
01:01:53,180 --> 01:01:56,380
哦，他给我关了。
Oh, he's turned off.

935
01:01:56,380 --> 01:01:58,020
哦，真是大胆！
Oh, very bold!

936
01:01:58,020 --> 01:02:00,580
杰里米和我现在开始玩起了不同的战术。
Jeremy and I were now
trying different tactics.

937
01:02:00,580 --> 01:02:07,180
他在小巷里晃悠，我则在主干道上，盼着红绿灯能手下留情。
He was wiggling in the back streets,
and I was on the big road,
hoping the lights would be kind.

938
01:02:08,780 --> 01:02:12,460
这比赛现在简直是场闹剧。
This race is now a race.

939
01:02:12,460 --> 01:02:15,460
第47名… 第48名…
47th... 48th...

940
01:02:17,340 --> 01:02:18,820
第49名，剩下十名。
49th. Ten to go.

941
01:02:20,820 --> 01:02:22,820
全是绿灯，绿灯，绿灯。
It's just green, green, green.

942
01:02:25,180 --> 01:02:28,460
我的计划全砸了，整个人陷入了乱局。
My plan hadn't worked
and I was in a complete tangle.

943
01:02:28,460 --> 01:02:30,340
百老汇是单行道。
Broadway is one way.

944
01:02:30,340 --> 01:02:33,540
哎呀！
Oh, no!

945
01:02:33,540 --> 01:02:35,300
下一个是哪儿？
What's the next one?

946
01:02:35,300 --> 01:02:39,420
要是去第七大道…算了，第七也是单行道。就是这样。
If I go to 7th... On, no,
7th is one way as well. It is.

947
01:02:39,420 --> 01:02:41,540
所以只能往左拐。
So I have to go left.

948
01:02:41,540 --> 01:02:44,340
哎呀，棒极了！
Oh, spiffing!

949
01:02:44,340 --> 01:02:46,140
这简直荒唐。
This is just ludicrous.

950
01:02:46,140 --> 01:02:48,020
只有一条路往北走。
There's only one road goes north.

951
01:02:48,020 --> 01:02:49,780
其余全是往南。
All the others go south.

952
01:02:49,780 --> 01:02:52,180
不过已经够糟了。
Still, could be worse.

953
01:02:55,060 --> 01:02:56,740
百老汇？
Broadway?

954
01:02:56,740 --> 01:03:00,460
不是就是剧院那儿吗？看看这儿！看看这儿！
Isn't that where the theatres are?
Look at that! Look at that!

955
01:03:00,460 --> 01:03:03,220
我现在在百老汇。百老汇！
I am on Broadway. Broadway!

956
01:03:05,100 --> 01:03:08,420
等一下…百老汇…我走错方向了。
Hang on... Broadway's...
I'm going the wrong way.

957
01:03:11,860 --> 01:03:14,820
绿灯更多，看这儿！
More green lights, look at this!

958
01:03:14,820 --> 01:03:17,460
第56名，第57名…
56th, 57th...

959
01:03:17,460 --> 01:03:20,140
我在想会不会是莱特曼。
I wonder if it's Letterman.

960
01:03:20,140 --> 01:03:22,340
第58名。
58th.

961
01:03:22,340 --> 01:03:24,700
好，这里是59号街。
Right, this is 59th.

962
01:03:24,700 --> 01:03:26,860
美国的朋友们，大家好。
Hello, America.

963
01:03:26,860 --> 01:03:29,300
这里是詹姆斯·梅，开着最新的法拉利。
This is James May
in the latest Ferrari.

964
01:03:33,180 --> 01:03:34,460
来吧！
Come on!

965
01:03:34,460 --> 01:03:40,140
我只要沿着59号街坚持五个街区，继续前进就行。
All I had to do was stick with 59th
Street for five blocks. Keep going.

966
01:03:40,140 --> 01:03:44,820
可是到了这个环形交叉口，59号街居然……卡住了。
But at this roundabout,
59th Street just...stopped.

967
01:03:44,820 --> 01:03:46,620
我的天啊！
Oh, God!

968
01:03:46,620 --> 01:03:50,020
哦，这下可就难了。
Oh, this is where it gets difficult.

969
01:03:50,020 --> 01:03:55,260
我现在只能靠我那著名的超强方向感了。
Now I was relying on my famously
brilliant sense of direction.

970
01:03:55,260 --> 01:03:57,100
我往那边走。
I'm going that way.

971
01:03:57,100 --> 01:03:59,300
那只是凭感觉。
That was a hunch.

972
01:03:59,300 --> 01:04:04,300
与此同时，杰里米决定用原始马力取代导航。
Jeremy, meanwhile, had decided to
replace navigation with raw power.

973
01:04:09,300 --> 01:04:12,140
47号街……
47th...

974
01:04:15,380 --> 01:04:18,100
来呀！
Come on!

975
01:04:18,100 --> 01:04:20,300
天呐！
Oh, God above!

976
01:04:20,300 --> 01:04:22,100
这阿姆斯特丹怎么只有单向？
How can Amsterdam only be one way?

977
01:04:22,100 --> 01:04:24,500
这还有啥意义？
What is the point?

978
01:04:24,500 --> 01:04:26,940
好，我要过去……哦，我下不去。
Right, I'll go across...
Oh, I can't go down there.

979
01:04:26,940 --> 01:04:28,660
哔——！
BLEEP!

980
01:04:35,860 --> 01:04:37,820
所有红灯都是绿的。
All the lights are green.

981
01:04:39,980 --> 01:04:42,380
还有53号。
And 53.

982
01:04:42,380 --> 01:04:45,980
63号。那是步行街。
63. That's pedestrianised.

983
01:04:45,980 --> 01:04:48,740
哦，彻底出岔子了。
Oh, it's all going wrong.

984
01:04:48,740 --> 01:04:51,860
拜托，让我下条街啊！
Let me go down a street,
for God's sake!

985
01:05:00,420 --> 01:05:01,980
现在我必须穿过去。
Now I've got to get across.

986
01:05:04,740 --> 01:05:09,020
9号街。我想去11号街，靠近11号街的交叉口。
9th. I want to go to 11th,
it's near the junction with 11th.

987
01:05:14,900 --> 01:05:17,420
66号街，开始啦。
66th. Here we go.

988
01:05:17,420 --> 01:05:20,780
西端大道。好听的名字！
West End Avenue. Lovely word!

989
01:05:23,220 --> 01:05:26,060
还要穿过五条街。
Five streets to go.

990
01:05:26,060 --> 01:05:31,420
10号街。这是11号街吗？
10th. Is this 11th?

991
01:05:33,060 --> 01:05:35,220
往上这边……
Off up here...

992
01:05:35,220 --> 01:05:37,140
快点！
Come on!

993
01:05:37,140 --> 01:05:39,220
61号……
61...

994
01:05:39,220 --> 01:05:41,580
60号……
60...

995
01:05:42,420 --> 01:05:43,700
58号。
58.

996
01:05:45,020 --> 01:05:47,140
59号街。好。
59th. Yes.

997
01:05:50,980 --> 01:05:53,020
哦，不！不！
Oh, no! No!

998
01:05:53,020 --> 01:05:55,380
不！不可能啊！
No! No, that's not possible.

999
01:05:55,380 --> 01:05:58,780
这儿出现了法拉利，简直不敢相信。
There's a Ferrari.
I cannot believe it.

1000
01:06:08,380 --> 01:06:11,140
与此同时……美洲大道出现了！
Meanwhile...
Avenue of the Americas is here!

1001
01:06:11,140 --> 01:06:12,900
这就是我想要的。
That's what I want.

1002
01:06:12,900 --> 01:06:15,180
给你，哈哈！
There you go, ha ha!

1003
01:06:15,180 --> 01:06:19,140
我要在美国开启我的职业生涯！
Going to launch my career in America!

1004
01:06:19,140 --> 01:06:21,900
斯图尔特一到就非常不爽……
Stuart was quite upset
when he finally arrived...

1005
01:06:21,900 --> 01:06:23,420
哦，啊——。
Oh, ahhh.

1006
01:06:26,540 --> 01:06:28,060
该死！
Damn!

1007
01:06:29,660 --> 01:06:32,020
失望？其实是崩溃了。
Disappointed? Gutted, actually.

1008
01:06:32,020 --> 01:06:34,340
最后的。坐你的甲壳虫。对。
Last. In your Beetle. Yeah.

1009
01:06:34,340 --> 01:06:36,540
别失望。
Don't be disappointed.

1010
01:06:36,540 --> 01:06:38,300
不过，这就是……？
But is this the...?

1011
01:06:38,300 --> 01:06:41,020
詹姆斯在里面。真的在里面？
James is in there. In there?

1012
01:06:41,020 --> 01:06:43,540
你以为他在跟莱特曼聊，是吧？
You think he's been talking
to Letterman, don't you?

1013
01:06:43,540 --> 01:06:46,340
是啊。或者《早安美国》。是啊。可不是那个。
Yeah. Or Good Morning America. Yeah.
It isn't that.

1014
01:06:48,140 --> 01:06:51,340
吸气，抬起。你应该能感受到左大腿内侧外展肌的舒展感。
Inhale, come up.
You should feel a beautiful stretch

1015
01:06:51,340 --> 01:06:55,060
吸气，抬起。把手臂抬到肩高。
in your abductor muscles on
the inside of your left thigh.

1016
01:06:55,060 --> 01:06:58,140
转向右侧。
Inhale, come up. Move your
arms up to shoulder height.

1017
01:06:58,140 --> 01:07:00,260
把双腿展开，大概三到四英尺的距离。
Let's turn to the right side.

1018
01:07:00,260 --> 01:07:03,100
那我们吸气。
Bring your legs out about
three to four feet apart.

1019
01:07:03,100 --> 01:07:05,700
现在，呼气。把手滑下来，沿着身体后侧。
So let's inhale.

1020
01:07:05,700 --> 01:07:08,980
需要的话就屈膝。
Now, start exhaling. Glide your
hands down the back of your body.

1021
01:07:08,980 --> 01:07:10,500
JAMES 咳嗽
Bend your knees if you have to.

1022
01:07:10,500 --> 01:07:12,740
休息一下，我抱歉。
JAMES COUGHS

1023
01:07:12,740 --> 01:07:15,020
掌声
Take a break. I'm sorry.

1024
01:07:15,020 --> 01:07:16,260
APPLAUSE
APPLAUSE

1025
01:07:17,900 --> 01:07:19,260
于是我们到了。
So there we are.

1026
01:07:19,260 --> 01:07:25,260
没有任何争议，梅赛德斯才是最佳座驾。
There we are, no question at all,
the Mercedes was the best car.

1027
01:07:25,260 --> 01:07:29,900
不过它太爱甩尾了，500码就得换一套轮胎！
Apart from the fact it was so
tail happy, it needed a new
set of tyres every 500 yards!

1028
01:07:29,900 --> 01:07:31,820
看，这辆法拉利颜值最高，
Look, the Ferrari
was the best looking,

1029
01:07:31,820 --> 01:07:35,980
它先把我送进工作室，也是赛道上最快的……
it got me to the studio first, it
was the fastest round the track...

1030
01:07:35,980 --> 01:07:37,820
它的价格是保时捷的两倍……
It cost twice as
much as the Porsche...

1031
01:07:37,820 --> 01:07:40,220
听好了，斯图尔特，这局你已经完蛋了，好吗？
Listen, Stuart,
you are out of this one, OK?

1032
01:07:40,220 --> 01:07:43,020
而且我们时间已经彻底用完了。
And we are completely out of time.

1033
01:07:43,020 --> 01:07:47,500
真的，已经是67分钟的节目了，对吧？
No, we really are. This programme
is already 67 minutes long, yes?

1034
01:07:47,500 --> 01:07:52,220
不过，詹姆斯坚持要解决我们5英镑的赌注。开始吧。
Thing is, though, James is insisting
we settle our £5 bet. Here we go.

1035
01:07:52,220 --> 01:07:54,900
现在我们就看看谁更快。
Now we'll find out
which is the quickest.

1036
01:07:55,900 --> 01:07:58,860
三、二、一……
Three, two, one...

1037
01:08:02,340 --> 01:08:07,740
这辆‘费扎’的起步真是惊人。
That is a remarkable
getaway by the Fezza.

1038
01:08:07,740 --> 01:08:13,520
我有563马力，他只有562。
I've got 563 horse power,
he's only got 562.

1039
01:08:14,020 --> 01:08:17,500
来晒晒这多出来的马力！
Let's see that extra horse!

1040
01:08:17,500 --> 01:08:19,020
它来了！
Here it comes!

1041
01:08:23,620 --> 01:08:26,500
那简直太接近了！
That is remarkably close!

1042
01:08:26,950 --> 01:08:27,600
快看看！
Look at it!

1043
01:08:28,861 --> 01:08:31,800
来吧！来吧！
Come on! Come on!

1044
01:08:32,360 --> 01:08:34,760
我要抓住它的鼻子！是的！是的！
I'm going to get him by a nose!
Yes! Yes!

1045
01:08:36,680 --> 01:08:40,000
很接近，真的很接近！简直是极限了。
Close. Really close!
That was very close.

1046
01:08:40,000 --> 01:08:41,960
现在要把它交给我吗？不要。
Want to give it to me now? No.

1047
01:08:41,960 --> 01:08:44,160
马上交出来，来嘛。
Hand it over now, come on.

1048
01:08:44,160 --> 01:08:46,320
等下，我们算算结果，因为真的很接近。
Hang on, let's settle this,
because it was close.

1049
01:08:46,320 --> 01:08:48,280
其实是冲线瞬间的抢先照。
It was in fact a photo finish.

1050
01:08:48,280 --> 01:08:50,480
我手里正好有那张照片。
And I have the photo here.

1051
01:08:50,480 --> 01:08:52,840
来看看。哎呀。是啊。
Have a look at that. Oh. Yeah.

1052
01:08:52,840 --> 01:08:54,640
哈哈！哎呀！
Aha ha! Oh!

1053
01:08:54,640 --> 01:08:56,360
不，真的这么接近！
No, it really was that close!

1054
01:08:56,360 --> 01:08:58,280
恐怕是平局！
I'm afraid it's a draw!

1055
01:08:58,280 --> 01:09:01,160
好，我把我的五镑留下！
Good. I keep my fiver!

1056
01:09:01,160 --> 01:09:05,000
不过，这么大的爆炸新闻下来，是时候收尾了。
But, on that bombshell,
it is now time to end.

1057
01:09:05,000 --> 01:09:09,960
我们会在节礼日八点回归，带来年度圣诞特辑，
We shall be back on Boxing Day
at eight o'clock with our annual
Christmas Special,

1058
01:09:09,960 --> 01:09:14,640
那期我们化身三位智者，从东方——伊拉克，
in which we are the three wise men
and we go from the East - Iraq,

1059
01:09:14,640 --> 01:09:19,480
确切地说，前往耶稣婴儿的诞生地——伯利恒。
to be precise - to the birthplace
of the baby Jesus in Bethlehem.

1060
01:09:19,480 --> 01:09:24,640
期待届时见到大家，期间祝大家圣诞超开心。晚安！
We hope to see you then, but in
the meantime, please have a very,
very happy Christmas. Goodnight!

1061
01:09:32,960 --> 01:09:36,360
